&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Manager will report to Lisa Durkin, FIT Cluster Director II, and will collaborate closely with colleagues across CJEA&amp;nbsp;and the Field Implementation Team (FIT). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
