&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About NexHealth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our healthcare system remains frustratingly analog. When you live in a world of one-tap car rides, instant meal delivery, and unlimited streaming, why do you still have to call to schedule a doctor’s appointment and fill out a clipboard in the waiting room?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NexHealth’s mission is to &lt;strong&gt;accelerate innovation in healthcare&lt;/strong&gt; by connecting patients, providers, and developers.&amp;nbsp;We’re building the &lt;strong&gt;infrastructure layer for modern healthcare, &lt;/strong&gt;connecting thousands of fragmented, on-premise, and closed EHR systems into a single, modern platform that powers software, APIs, payments, and patient experiences across the ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Founded: 2017&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headquarters: San Francisco, CA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Funding: $177M Series C&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employees: 200+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by tens of thousands of providers and hundreds of health-tech developers — forging the infrastructure layer that modern healthcare needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Engineering Manager to lead the development of the Sync Core. Synchronizer provides native, real-time, bidirectional synchronization between numerous EHR systems of record and NexHealth’s harmonized central database. This foundation enables healthcare innovators to focus on improving patient experiences and outcomes—while we handle the underlying infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This work represents step two in our three-step master plan. You’ll play a critical role in increasing engineering quality and execution velocity across the organization, making it easier and faster to build and extend Synchronizers. You’ll partner with multiple engineering teams and product managers to define the next-generation Synchronizer API offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for a hands-on leader who thrives in fast-paced environments and enjoys solving novel systems challenges. No prior healthcare experience required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and develop a high-performing team:&lt;/strong&gt; Hire exceptional engineers and support their long-term growth through mentorship, coaching, and leadership development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar on engineering excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Uphold strong technical standards through processes like architecture reviews, testing, and code quality practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive platform strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with engineering and product leadership to shape and execute long-term platform roadmaps, including the next-generation Synchronizer API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-team execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate closely across multiple engineering groups to deliver complex, cross-cutting, high-impact initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster a strong engineering culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Promote ownership, innovation, reliability, and continuous improvement as core expectations for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading engineering teams, including managing managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of coaching, developing, and supporting both engineers and managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience delivering complex, large-scale infrastructure or distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment in balancing engineering velocity with long-term technical quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration skills with the ability to partner effectively across Product, Sales, Customer Success, and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to define and drive technical and organizational roadmaps with measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder mindset with a history of scaling teams and systems in fast-paced, high-growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership and initiative, especially in ambiguous and evolving contexts&lt;br&gt;The ability to act as a change agent, helping guide our transformation into an API-first organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action and data-driven decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-principles thinking applied to both technical and organizational challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep care for people development, team health, and long-term success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment with NexHealth’s mission and core values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS in Computer Science or a related field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actual salaries will vary depending on factors including but not limited to location, experience, and performance. The range listed is just the base salary component of NexHealth’s total compensation package for employees. Other benefits may include stock options, an unlimited paid time off policy, and up to 100% coverage on medical, vision and dental insurance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NexHealth Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$268,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full Medical, Dental, and Vision (up to 100% covered)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401K and commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-impact work that directly improves the healthcare experience for millions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the customer’s problems, not yours&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;When making decisions, think from the perspective of the customer. It’s easy to make decisions that make our lives simpler, but not the customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do the things others are not willing to do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a Nexer, always go after the hardest problems. Pursue things at the highest quality. Move at the fastest pace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take ownership&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Act like a founder. Own your roles, destinies, mistakes, behavior, and our mission. The buck stops with each of us - no blaming or excuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Say what’s on your mind, with positive intent&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Be direct, proactive, transparent, and frequent in your communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Default trust&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a Nexer, you do not have to earn trust, trust is given to you by default. If we by default trust each other, our speed of communication, feedback, information sharing, and overall improvements will be a lot faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think in first principles&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We first identify the problem and then break it down to its fundamentals before diving into solutions. We constantly ask “why” to validate our assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status. We provide reasonable accommodation for individuals with disabilities to participate in the application or interview process. Contact &lt;strong&gt;talent@nexhealth.com&lt;/strong&gt; to request assistance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

mbaexchange-adasia:greenhouse:7957263.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h1&gt;(Senior) Executive, Creator Management will be responsible for sourcing, onboarding, and growing high-potential creators within AnyMind network, with a strong focus on Youtube monetization and scalable content strategies.&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for driving &lt;strong&gt;Youtube revenue including Youtube Adsense and YouTube Shopping&lt;/strong&gt;. You will build and maintain a high-performing network of creators (KOLs/KOCs) who generate engaging content views and sales.&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creator Growth &amp;amp; Monetization:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Youtube Revenue targets through creator incubation and monetization with brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the strategy for identifying and recruiting high-converting creators (KOCs) at scale. You determine the right mix of creators for each client and each campaign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze content and channel performance (Views, Long/ Short form Videos, Affiliate Videos, etc). Identify underperforming creators and replace them; identify high performers and double down on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow and manage emerging content creators at scale to match brand client demand and platform strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creator Engagement &amp;amp; Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with creators, agencies, and brand clients to increase creator commercial value mapping with brand campaigns for the highest client satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure smooth internal coordination across regional teams and cross functions: BD, account, etc…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to strategic partnership with key platform partner, YouTube, and incremental revenue initiatives such as branded creator IP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–4 years of experience in &lt;strong&gt;MCN, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affiliate Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Social Commerce&lt;/strong&gt; roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with KOLs, KOCs, artists, talent managers, agencies, or brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;YouTube and all YouTube programs: YouTube Shopping, YouTube Shorts, and monetization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple stakeholders and drive performance targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication in English and Vietnamese, and relationship-building skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure and meet revenue-driven KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in both verbal and written English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing network content creators within entertainment, lifestyle, music, or commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic mindset with data-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial spirit and ownership mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in affiliate marketing or the creator-to-commerce model is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Review (2 times per year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Bonus (1 time per year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TGIF, monthly birthday, and other fun events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MacBook to be provided&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good chance to explore new trends in the digital market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to learn and work with the most advanced advertising technology platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a professional, active, international and dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

