&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a Solution Architect on our presales team, you will serve as the technical overlay for our most complex public sector opportunities. You will partner closely with Sales, Delivery, Product, and Engineering to design, present, and validate solutions that address customer objectives across&amp;nbsp;their Microsoft&amp;nbsp;initiatives, while also helping architect and operationalize our secure cloud enclaves (including FedRAMP High, DoD IL5, and IL6).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role blends Solution Architecture with elements of Technical Program Management. You will&amp;nbsp;help&amp;nbsp;drive architecture decisions, align cross-functional stakeholders, and ensure we can consistently deliver secure, scalable solutions in environments where compliance, identity, segmentation, and partner ecosystem constraints materially shape what&amp;nbsp;is possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Engage with customers, prospects, and channel partners to understand business needs and propose solutions that leverage AvePoint’s offerings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Act as the technical overlay for complex, high-risk, non-standard opportunities, including scenarios that challenge or exceed current solution patterns. Drive alignment on “the right way to solve” and document repeatable approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Assist in the architecture and technical program management of our secure cloud enclaves, including FedRAMP High, IL5, and IL6 environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support technical planning across identity and access, segmentation/multi-tenancy, connectivity, and secure operational requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Coordinate across internal teams and external stakeholders to remove blockers and maintain delivery momentum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create and deliver compelling presentations, demos, and proposals that articulate the value, security posture, and operational outcomes of our solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Provide technical leadership and guidance to customers and internal teams on best practices for architecture, design, and implementation, including secure-by-design guidance appropriate for regulated environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Delivery, and other stakeholders to ensure alignment and coordination of sales activities and deliverables through the full sales cycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Stay current on trends in AI, Microsoft,&amp;nbsp;Google&amp;nbsp;and secure cloud architecture. Share insights and field feedback with Product and Engineering to influence roadmap and enablement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support marketing initiatives and events (remote or in-person) that drive pipeline creation and customer growth opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Partner with Sales Enablement to ensure teams can hold consistent, accurate technical and security conversations that improve buyer confidence and influence outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Actively own and participate in speaking events across&amp;nbsp;Federal and SLED events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At least 10 years of experience in a solution architect, technical consultant, or similar role in the software industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Copilot, Microsoft Azure, and Microsoft 365 platforms and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and interpersonal skills, with the ability to communicate complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving, analytical, and creative thinking skills, with the ability to work independently and as part of a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel up to&amp;nbsp;40% of the time, as required by the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ability to obtain and maintain a U.S. Secret security clearance (or eligibility to do so).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience with Microsoft ecosystem technologies (e.g., Microsoft 365, identity concepts, and security fundamentals).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Demonstrated strength translating highly technical topics for mixed audiences, including technical buyers and executive stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience operating in regulated environments (FedRAMP, DoD, or adjacent compliance/security frameworks) is strongly preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating as an overlay: diagnosing ambiguous requirements, driving architecture clarity, and creating reusable patterns that scale across the field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;⁠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;The Salary Range for this role is $190,000 - $220,000. At AvePoint, we strive to offer competitive, fair, and equitable total rewards. The listed salary range represents a good faith estimate, with final offers based on location, experience, skills, and qualifications. The listed range reflects base salary only; our total rewards include base salary, comprehensive benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k) with match, unlimited PTO), and depending on the role, bonuses, commissions, or equity (RSUs). We welcome compensation discussions—apply even if your expectations fall outside the range.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

sggc-moloco:greenhouse:7728195003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco builds some of the most powerful AI advertising solutions in the world. Our name—short for &quot;machine learning company&quot;—reflects our core mission: democratizing access to the advanced AI that has historically been reserved for tech giants. Led by machine learning pioneers who built some of the most successful ad systems at Google, including YouTube&#39;s monetization engine and key search advertising technologies, we&#39;re transforming how businesses grow and compete in the digital economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built with AI from day one, Moloco’s planet-scale machine learning platform powers a suite of solutions for advertising growth and monetization. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/solutions/moloco-ads&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Ads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is an AI-powered platform that delivers real business outcomes for mobile app marketers through performance-based user acquisition. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/solutions/moloco-commerce-media&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Commerce Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enables retailers and marketplaces to build revenue-generating ad businesses that balance user experience and advertiser performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is headquartered in Silicon Valley, with offices in Seattle, New York, San Francisco, Seoul, Beijing, Singapore, Gurgaon, Tokyo, Shanghai, London, Tel Aviv, and Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is a truly rewarding place to work and in an exciting period of growth, which you could be a part of. Join us today and apply now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You’ll Be Contributing to Moloco:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Growth Manager in Japan, you&#39;ll own the strategic success and revenue expansion of a portfolio of key and enterprise advertiser accounts. You&#39;ll build client relationships, define growth playbooks, and lead complex commercial strategies across mobile apps, gaming, commerce, and streaming - operating with a high degree of autonomy and shaping how Moloco grows in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for someone who doesn&#39;t just execute - they define how the team operates, mentor peers, and bring genuine strategic influence to both client and internal conversations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note on Level &amp;amp; Title: The Senior Growth Manager title spans a range of senior experience levels. Your level and title will be determined through the interview process based on your background, scope of past responsibility, and demonstrated impact. We welcome applications from candidates with 7+ years of relevant experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Account Ownership &amp;amp; Client Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategic direction and revenue outcomes of a portfolio of key accounts in Japan, acting as a trusted senior partner to client leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and sustain relationships with senior client executives - shaping the agenda, not just responding to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead senior client forums including QBRs, executive briefings, and multi-stakeholder strategy sessions with confidence and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep knowledge of each client&#39;s business model, market dynamics, and long-term growth ambitions to proactively identify aligned opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revenue Strategy &amp;amp; Commercial Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute portfolio-level revenue strategies - driving upsell, cross-sell, and expansion across your book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own commercial negotiations for complex, multi-product deals - structuring incentives, managing trade-offs, and closing with a clear value narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use advanced data storytelling to move senior stakeholders to action on budget reallocation, new product adoption, and geo expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify systemic patterns across your portfolio and build scalable commercial frameworks that the team can replicate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Campaign Performance &amp;amp; Platform Expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a sharp view of how clients are operating on Moloco&#39;s DSP,&amp;nbsp; spotting patterns, inefficiencies, and strategic opportunities across your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide clients on how to get more out of the platform through high-impact recommendations on bidding, budget strategy, creative direction, and expansion levers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex performance data and platform dynamics into clear, business-oriented narratives that build client confidence and drive action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose performance root causes and lead cross-functional alignment on solutions, not just flagging issues, but driving resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Do I Know if the Role is Right For Me?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in account management, growth, or strategic sales, with a strong track record in programmatic marketing, mobile advertising, or ad tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to own enterprise and key accounts from strategy through to commercial close with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging senior client executive and driving decisions at that level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven contribution beyond individual accounts: playbook creation, team development, vertical ownership, or org-level impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive-level communication and presence: runs senior client conversations with authority, clarity, and strategic intent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio-level commercial thinking: sees patterns, builds frameworks, and scales impact across accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical fluency: designs and interprets complex performance analyses; turns data into senior-level narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy: defines their own priorities, structures ambiguous problems, and drives outcomes without waiting to be directed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-ego multiplier: shares learnings generously, elevates peers, and builds systems that outlast their involvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Language&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native/fluent Japanese · Business-level English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-10b2a5c2-7fff-9123-b3ca-404b4268f3fb&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Thrive: Benefits and Well-Being:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take care of you and create the conditions for you to do the best work of your career. Through a lens of inclusion, we offer innovative benefits that empower our employees to take care of themselves and their families so they can do the best work of their lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Humility:&lt;/strong&gt; Everyone’s voice is respected, valued, and heard. With humility, we become more open and accessible to each other. We win, lose, and learn together. Accountability and feedback are essential to our success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncapped Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; We see all situations as opportunities to learn, grow, and improve as individuals and as an organization. We seek diverse perspectives, encourage curiosity, and promote experimentation to push the boundaries of what’s possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create Real Value: &lt;/strong&gt;We pursue the most impactful opportunities with rigor and integrity. We take intelligent risks and make disciplined trade-offs to maintain deep focus. We help our customers win by delivering durable value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go Further Together: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re one team working towards one mission and vision. We collaborate proactively and inclusively, involving the right people at the right time and in the right way. We strive to create a more equitable workplace. We won’t let each other fail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Resources:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/blogs&quot;&gt;Moloco Company Blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/leadership&quot;&gt;Moloco Leadership&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/newsroom&quot;&gt;Moloco Newsroom&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Use in Interviews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process is designed to get to know the real you. Unless a round specifically includes AI as part of what&#39;s being assessed, we ask that candidates engage without AI assistance. Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.cloud/hubfs/careers/AI%20Use%20in%20Interviews.pdf&quot;&gt;AI Use in Interviews Policy&lt;/a&gt; before your interview to understand what to expect. Failure to comply with this policy may impact your candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creating a diverse workforce and a culture of inclusion and belonging is core to our existence. To reach our goals, diversity of talent and thought is a critical component of how we operate as an organization. Our workforce is our superpower, and we know that fostering a culture of inclusion, authenticity, and belonging gives us the greatest opportunity to achieve our vision to become the scaling engine for the Internet economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is an equal opportunity employer. We highly value diversity in our current and future employees and do not discriminate (including in our hiring and promotion practices) on the basis of race, color, creed, religion, national origin, age, sex and gender, gender expression and identity, sexual orientation, marital status, ancestry, physical or mental disability, military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your privacy matters to us. By applying, you acknowledge that you’ve reviewed our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.cloud/hubfs/careers/Candidate%20Privacy%20Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

